ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Pop Art
Board: /styles/pop-art
Companions: pop-art-starter.html, pop-art-study.ai, pop-art-study.psd

Artboards
1. Three repeats, 3000 × 1200 px. One invented product, flat, black outline, a field of regular red dots behind it.
2. A single unit, larger, same object, so the dots read as drawn circles and not as a photo screen.

Palette
Ground #f7f4ee. Black #111111. Dot red #e31c23. Blue #0047ab. Yellow #f5c400.

Rules
- Flat fills only. No gradient, no photograph, no trademark.
- Dots are a constructed pattern.
- Invent the product. No can, no face, no flag, no existing panel.
